In this repository, we added noise to the results in the previous artificial_plasma repository.

The noise was added at the beginning. The amplitude of the envelope of the electric field was varied randomly (small fluctuations). 

The phase of the envelope of the electric field was varied randomly (small fluctuations).

The sweep was done from 0.1 * Pcr to 20 * Pcr, with increments of 0.1 * Pcr
